# A project shape that can only fire after reasoning (test material for Appendix C.6 step 3): it targets
# the subjects of dwis:HasValue, a super-property of HasDynamicValue that no manifest asserts and that the
# reasoner adds, and asks each of them for a measurable quantity. In the SmartConnect manifest, 15 of the
# 254 data points with a signal name no quantity, so the manifest is accepted by the pre-processing pass
# and downgraded to core-only by the re-check.
@prefix sh:   <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#> .
@prefix dwis: <http://d-wis.org/> .

<http://d-wis.org/shapes/ValueNeedsQuantityShape>
    a sh:NodeShape ;
    sh:targetSubjectsOf dwis:HasValue ;
    sh:property [
        sh:path dwis:IsOfMeasurableQuantity ;
        sh:minCount 1 ;
        sh:message "A data point that carries a value names its measurable quantity." ;
    ] .
